g.vn/images/16e68248c10840f29ff4e7e6953cc974b370631431e637f72924856093b1ea8c4961da733b71ae0f779212170af70c46/tp-287hctd4.jpg.avif\"/> </figure> <figure> <img alt=\"tp-287hctd5.jpg\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/16e68248c10840f29ff4e7e6953cc974b370631431e637f72924856093b1ea8cd0abe82da942b874ad06dd5efeaf83b6/tp-287hctd5.jpg.avif\"/> </figure> <figure> <img alt=\"tp-287hctd7.jpg\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/16e68248c10840f29ff4e7e6953cc974b370631431e637f72924856093b1ea8cfd0dbe43c2dff15740639b839b8bea85/tp-287hctd7.jpg.avif\"/> </figure> <figure> <img alt=\"tp-287hctd6.jpg\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/16e68248c10840f29ff4e7e6953cc974b370631431e637f72924856093b1ea8cc6a59d883c4b2604ea62cc53e066b4aa/tp-287hctd6.jpg.avif\"/> </figure> <figcaption> Các tiết mục văn nghệ tại phần mở đầu đại hội. <br/> </figcaption>\n</div>  </div></body></html>"}